# Dependencies are installed inside the image; the host's bun/npm layout
# (symlinks, .bin) must never overwrite them — it breaks `npx prisma`,
# `npm run build`, and buildkit layer mounts.
**/node_modules
# Build outputs are regenerated in the image.
**/dist
# Local-only config and caches.
**/.env
.git
.gitignore
**/.next
**/coverage
# Go build cache (d2-compiler builds from the module proxy).
**/bin
